OL,3,CProgramme listings for
OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 11 APR
OL,4,G1300FZakia
OL,5,     GZakia sits in for Jamz and chats
OL,6,     Gto Ego Ella May about her new
OL,7,     Galbum Good Intentions. They talk
OL,8,     Gabout the making of the record,
OL,9,     Gthemes running through it and
OL,10,     Gmore.
OL,11,G1500FGilles Peterson
OL,12,     GGilles invites Ezra Collective's
OL,13,     Gdrummer, Femi Koleoso, and
OL,14,     Gsaxophonist Courtney Pine into
OL,15,     Gthe studio to celebrate two
OL,16,     Gmilestones in British jazz.
OL,17,G1800FThe Stuart Maconie Funk and Soul
OL,18,     FShow
OL,19,     GAndy Platts from Mamas Gun is
OL,20,     GStuart's guest, talking about the
OL,21,     Gnew album DIG!.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
