OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 11 APR
OL,4,G2100FDon Letts' Culture Clash Radio
OL,5,     GDon breaks format with an
OL,6,     Gessential selection of reggae
OL,7,     Gcovers. Expect bass-heavy takes
OL,8,     Gon the likes of The Beatles,
OL,9,     GBronski Beat, Ray Charles, Dusty
OL,10,     GSpringfield and Blur.
OL,11,G2300FSHERELLE
OL,12,     GSHERELLE lights up your Saturday
OL,13,     Gnight with some high-NRG drum and
OL,14,     Gbass.
OL,15,G0030FThe Sweatbox
OL,16,     GStalwart of the drum and bass
OL,17,     Gscene, Breakage, takes over the
OL,18,     GSweatbox with 30 minutes of his
OL,19,     Gown material.
